I arrive at the office.
It is a large software company.
I walk inside.
My colleague Peter is already there.
He is very friendly.
"Good morning, Maya," Peter says.
"Good morning, Peter," I say.
I walk over to my space.
I sit at my desk.
I turn on my computer.
I have a cup of coffee.
It is black and hot.
I drink the coffee.
I work as a software engineer.
I look at the screen.
I type code on my computer.
The work is very exciting.
I am happy with my job.
